  "diagnostics": [
    "The first reader treated every CURRENT revalidation as a cold open. Installation also revalidates CURRENT; bind each actual ledger reseal to its original complete open boundaries.",
    "The second reader omitted the separately derived revision-zero future ledger from the bootstrap wrapper; initialize from the original bootstrap rather than copying a later snapshot.",
    "Two initial peer negatives broke child STORE schema or crossed the killed-process lifetime. They remain failures, not qualification. The corrected mutations use original parent-owned callbacks and require exact target-layer rejection.",
    "The next retirement probe derives 951 callbacks but has no complete negative or portable qualification and does not close that layer."
  ],
